  "root_cause": "pollset_work published a stack worker handle before wakeup-fd initialization. Failed initialization leaked its wrapper and could register an invalid descriptor in the fork-tracking list.",
  "fix": "Initialize output handle to null, free the wrapper on initialization failure, and register/publish only after successful initialization.",
